<title>ITALY: Italy's Ciampi says bid system to be simplified.</title>
<headline>Italy's Ciampi says bid system to be simplified.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Treasury Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi said on Wednesday that the government planned to simplify the system of public buy offers, or OPAs.</p>
<p>Ciampi said the government was preparing measures seeking to &quot;redefine and simplify the OPA system, to protect both the small shareholder and enable market operations to proceed with ease,&quot; Ciampi told a meeting of the Italian banking association (ABI).</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
